{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-32a","no":"EP.32A","tag":"第32話 番外 · 歸還吞下的歌","title":"歸還吞下的歌","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-32a:1","s":"n","t":"第四聲鐘響。武曲又熄滅一縷光，距離第十二聲，還剩八響。","bg":"zwForge","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"bell","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:2","s":"moka","t":"我唱歌很差，妳知道吧。","x":"base","l":{"who":"moka","x":"base"},"c":{"who":"mu","x":"sad"},"r":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-32a:3","s":"yeon","t":"知道。饒舌也差。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-32a:4","s":"moka","t":"現在提這個幹嘛！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-32a:5","s":"yeon","t":"因為在場的人，都知道你唱得差。所以沒關係。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-32a:6","s":"n","t":"第五聲鐘響。Neo單膝跪下，手撐地。灰色已經爬到下巴。","sfx":"bell"},{"id":"ep-32a:7","s":"neo","t":"快點。節奏我沒把握，不過能補個低音。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-32a:8","s":"yun","t":"我會十二首合婚歌，歌詞全都很奇怪。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-32a:9","s":"mu","t":"……你們想幹什麼？別這樣，太可笑了。","x":"waver"},{"id":"ep-32a:10","s":"yeon","t":"（可笑啊。就是要可笑。這次，不讓笑聲對著你。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-32a:11","s":"n","t":"Yeoni清清嗓子。在KTV，她也總是負責搖鈴鼓。可今天沒有鈴鼓，只有聲音。"},{"id":"ep-32a:12","s":"moka","t":"可笑也沒關係。這次換我們逗笑大家，你只管聽。","x":"base","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-32a:13","s":"n","t":"摩卡吸氣，用尾巴敲地。篤，篤，篤。停一拍，再篤。","bg":"zwForge","tone":"dark","bgm":"fireFestival","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:14","s":"n","t":"然後第一句，摩卡破音了。像雞叫，格外響。","sfx":"drum"},{"id":"ep-32a:15","s":"n","t":"Yeoni笑出了聲，卻邊笑邊跟著唱。不知道歌詞，就跟著調子走，連調也錯了。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"laugh"},"c":{"who":"mu","x":"surprise"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-32a:16","s":"yun","t":"哈哈。你們倆都低了半音。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-32a:17","s":"n","t":"閏月笑著加入，配上奇怪的歌詞：八字合就全都合，不合的話打半折。"},{"id":"ep-32a:18","s":"n","t":"Neo拖出長長的低音。聲音裡的金氣震動鐵壁，節奏慢了半拍。"},{"id":"ep-32a:19","s":"n","t":"亂七八糟，四個人像在各唱各的歌。唯獨尾巴的節奏從沒動搖。篤，篤，篤。停，再篤。","fx":"burst","sfx":"drum","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:20","s":"mu","t":"大家都在笑，邊唱邊笑。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-32a:21","s":"yeon","t":"（沒錯。我們在笑，卻不是在嘲笑誰。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-32a:22","s":"n","t":"無聲眼裡有什麼流了下來。他想閉眼，像在臺上那樣，卻沒有閉。他一直看著那些笑臉。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-32a:23","s":"n","t":"第六聲鐘被歌聲淹沒，沒人聽見。","sfx":"bell"},{"id":"ep-32a:24","s":"n","t":"歌結束了。準確地說，是大家喘不過氣，停了。摩卡扶著膝蓋呼哧呼哧地喘。","bg":"zwForge","bgm":"fireFestival","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"cheer"},"c":{"who":"mu","x":"waver"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"moved"},"scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:25","s":"n","t":"Yeoni鼓起掌，摩卡、閏月也跟上。Neo合起發抖的手掌，稍遲的聲音匯入節拍。"},{"id":"ep-32a:26","s":"n","t":"掌聲越過舞臺，匯向臺下。跪著的少年朝聲音的方向抬起頭。","im":true,"fx":"heart","sfx":"sparkle","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-32a:27","s":"moka","t":"這是那天的。遲了吧，遲了好幾年。對不起。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-32a:28","s":"mu","t":"……可我沒唱歌。","x":"waver"},{"id":"ep-32a:29","s":"yeon","t":"唱了。那天你唱到了最後一句，用破掉的聲音。這掌聲，是給唱到最後的人。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-32a:30","s":"n","t":"無聲胸前的黑羽顫動著，從尖端開始變色。墨黑變成灰，灰又變成溫暖的金色。","im":true,"fx":"transform","sfx":"coin","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"transform","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-32a:31","s":"yun","t":"化祿。真的成了。忌轉成了祿。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-32a:32","s":"n","t":"羽毛伸出的黑線也染上金色。它們不再勒緊武曲，反而將光注入武曲體內。"},{"id":"ep-32a:33","s":"n","t":"被縛的星開始呼吸。鐵色恢復為銀色，鐵壁上的黑鏽像鱗片般剝落。","bg":"zwForge","bgm":"flowingLight","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"neo","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"mu","x":"calm"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"base"},"scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:34","s":"n","t":"「……謝謝。堵住的東西流動了。金屬，本就是承載流動之物的容器。」"},{"id":"ep-32a:35","s":"n","t":"Neo後頸的灰褪去，越過肩膀和手肘，退到手腕以下。只有指尖，還留著一塊硬幣大小的黑痕。","fx":"metal","sfx":"chime","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:36","s":"neo","t":"剩下的我來承擔。這不是該轉給武曲的債。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-32a:37","s":"yeon","t":"又來這句。以後要全告訴我。","x":"disappoint"},{"id":"ep-32a:38","s":"neo","t":"我答應過。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-32a:39","s":"n","t":"堆在角落的灰燈一盞盞亮起。光從門縫流出，回到原來的主人那裡。"},{"id":"ep-32a:40","s":"n","t":"第七聲鐘響，卻變了聲音。不再像敲鐵，而是清澈地散開。這已不是數著正午的鐘，是宣告門打開的鐘。","im":true,"sfx":"bell","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-32a:41","s":"yeon","t":"（正午沒來。黑月扯快的時間鬆開了。）","x":"think","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"think"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"}},{"id":"ep-32a:42","s":"n","t":"Yeoni蹲到Neo身旁，用指尖觸碰殘留的黑痕。冰冷，像一塊金屬。"},{"id":"ep-32a:43","s":"yeon","t":"剛才我說話時，真的不疼？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-32a:44","s":"neo","t":"不疼。妳喊叫和說話時，火的形狀不一樣。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-32a:45","s":"yeon","t":"（火的形狀。爆發的火，和點亮的火。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-32a:46","s":"neo","t":"今天，妳點亮了火。所以大家能在那火旁唱歌。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-32a:47","s":"yeon","t":"……這種話，等你的手全好了再說。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-32a:48","s":"n","t":"Neo輕輕拍了拍Yeoni的肩膀。這次，節奏依然慢了半拍。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"zwForge","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwForge","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwForge 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-32a:49","s":"n","t":"回市集的迴廊上，閏月放慢腳步，把戴手套的右手抱在胸前。","bg":"zwMarket","bgm":"moonDawn","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yun","x":"pain"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"scene":{"background":"zwMarket","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwMarket","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwMarket 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:50","s":"yeon","t":"閏月先生，你的手。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-32a:51","s":"yun","t":"剛才吞了太多線。洞已經過手腕了。","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-32a:52","s":"n","t":"手套邊緣，黑色裂痕爬到手腕上方，像細細的墨線。"},{"id":"ep-32a:53","s":"yun","t":"沒事。武曲解開了，小姐的命盤也會清亮許多。做生意的本錢算保住了。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-32a:54","s":"yeon","t":"又說這句。大家都不許再說沒事。從現在起，說一次罰一次。","x":"disappoint"},{"id":"ep-32a:55","s":"yun","t":"罰多少？","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-32a:56","s":"yeon","t":"十根烤串，交給摩卡。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-32a:57","s":"n","t":"市集的星燈重新亮起。灰臉星人的臉頰恢復色彩，有人在討價還價時哼起歌。","bg":"zwMarket","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":{"who":"mu","x":"base"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"},"scene":{"background":"zwMarket","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwMarket","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwMarket 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-32a:58","s":"n","t":"迴廊盡頭，一個小星人跑來，見到無聲便遲疑了一下，隨後遞出掌心大小的燈。正是剛才在審判臺被沒收的那盞。"},{"id":"ep-32a:59","s":"mu","t":"給我？明明是我搶走的。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-32a:60","s":"n","t":"孩子沒回答，把燈塞進無聲手裡就跑。跑了幾步，又回頭吐了吐舌頭。"},{"id":"ep-32a:61","s":"yeon","t":"這是原諒，還是捉弄？","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-32a:62","s":"moka","t":"都是。島上向來這樣。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-32a:63","s":"mu","t":"羽毛變成金色以後，就不長翅膀了。只是個普通人。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-32a:64","s":"moka","t":"回島上來。今年迎日出的舞臺要重辦了，我給你在烤串攤旁邊騰個位。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-32a:65","s":"mu","t":"要是又破音呢？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-32a:66","s":"moka","t":"那就再笑，然後再鼓掌。這就是舞臺。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-32a:67","s":"n","t":"無聲笑了。嗓音沙啞，可那確實是笑聲。"},{"id":"ep-32a:68","s":"mu","t":"有件事要告訴你們。給我羽毛的聲音，常說一句話。財帛的房間裡有容器。","x":"serious","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"zwMarket","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwMarket","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwMarket 배경에서 진행되는 mu의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-32a:69","s":"yeon","t":"容器。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-32a:70","s":"mu","t":"戌的房間。進去的星人，沒有一個回來過。而且那裡會傳出拖鐵鏈的聲音，每逢下雨。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-32a:71","s":"yeon","t":"（鐵鏈。雨。……徐寒雨。）","x":"think","im":true,"shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"zwMarket","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwMarket","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"zwMarket 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
